NAME
       neo - text editor

SYNOPSIS
       neo [file]

DESCRIPTION
       A full-screen editor in the style of nano: the text fills the
       screen, the cursor sits where you type, and the keys are shown
       at the bottom.

KEYS
       Ctrl-O   save
       Ctrl-X   exit
       Ctrl-W   search
       Ctrl-K   cut the current line
       Ctrl-U   paste
       Ctrl-G   help
       arrows, PgUp, PgDn, Home, End   move around

SETTINGS
       The settings menu covers line numbers, tab width, expanding tabs
       into spaces, automatic indentation and trimming trailing
       whitespace on save. Save settings writes them to ~/.neorc, which
       is read at startup.

FILES
       ~/.neorc

SEE ALSO
       cfm(1), less(1)
